      "description": "KPI-ENE-005 · Waste Percentage\nFormule (catalogus): waste_kg / raw_material_kg * 100\nBron in de demo: Afval = (afgekeurde pakken + pakken van HOLD/REJECTED-batches) x dichtheid; grondstof = gedoseerde kg.\nLet op: Spoel- en CIP-verliezen ontbreken; die komen met de CIP-simulatie.\nDoel 5, waarschuwing 6, kritiek 8 % (catalogus).\nUren zijn procesuren (demo draait 15x versneld)."
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Over de gekozen periode",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 19,
        "w": 5,
        "h": 7
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "tdengine-datasource",
            "uid": "vla-tdengine"
          },
          "queryType": "SQL",
          "formatType": "Table",
          "sql": "select sum(case when `input`='waste_kg' then `value` else 0.0 end) / sum(case when `input`='raw_material_kg' then `value` else 0.0 end) * 100 as v from idp.kpi_input where kpi_id='KPI-ENE-005' and `line`='$lijn' and ts >= $from and ts < $to"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percent",
          "decimals": 2,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
